Package: lg-gram-fingerprint
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, libfprint-2-tod1, fprintd, curl, gcab
Recommends: libpam-fprintd, unzip
Description: driver for the Goodix GXFP5A8B fingerprint sensor (LG gram)
 libfprint TOD driver and setup tool for the Goodix GXFP5A8B ("Geneva",
 GF3268 + GM168SEC) SPI fingerprint sensor found in LG gram laptops
 (e.g. 15Z90N). Works with fprintd for login, lock screen and sudo.
 .
 Run `sudo lg-gram-fp-tool setup` once after installing: it downloads the
 Goodix Windows driver from Microsoft Update to extract the sensor
 configuration (no proprietary files are shipped) and pairs the sensor.
